<section class="section pricing-justification-section">
  <div class="container flex-column align-center">
    <div class="justification-card">
      <h2 class="justification-heading">Why It's $297 and Not $1,500</h2>

      <p class="justification-text">
        Because we build one thing, for one trade, over and over. There's no discovery phase, because we already know what a contractor's site needs. There's no custom design process, because the structure is proven and we're adding your work to it. There's no account manager, no strategy deck, and no monthly reporting call that exists mainly to justify the invoice.
      </p>

      <p class="justification-text">
        Agencies charge $1,199 to $4,199 a month because every client is a new experiment. You'd be paying for their learning curve. We already climbed it — once — because we only serve one trade.
      </p>

      <p class="justification-punchline">It isn't cheaper work. It's narrower work.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
